// Shared project defaults. A private developer build can inject the model key
// on one Xcode launch without putting it in the project or app bundle. The app
// then keeps it in this install's device-only Keychain for untethered launches.
// CABIN_LOCAL_OPENAI_API_KEY is deliberately not given a default here: the
// scheme expands an undefined setting to an empty string anyway, and an empty
// definition in this file wins over Local.xcconfig when Xcode expands scheme
// environment variables, which silently blanks the injected key.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
